title: "Turkish Coffee Cup Reading Symbols (Falyora)"
type: dataset
authors:
  - name: "Falyora"
    website: "https://falyora.app"
url: "https://falyora.app"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-10-29
license: CC-BY-4.0
abstract: >-
  Structured bilingual (Turkish and English) gists of Falyora's AI-assisted, human-checked
  dictionary of 40 Turkish coffee cup reading (tasseography) symbols: the
  traditional folk reading, Falyora's reading, and a gist for each of five
  cup zones (rim, side wall, bottom, handle area, saucer).
keywords:
  - tasseography
  - Turkish coffee
  - coffee cup reading
  - kahve falı
  - symbols
  - folklore
